# Writable non-TLS symbols allowed in the vim and xxd binaries.
# The build fails on any other symbol in (__DATA,__data|__bss|__common):
# Vim runs concurrently on ios_system threads, so mutable state must be __thread.
# Entries are read-only after load (pointer tables) or intentionally process-wide.

# linker-synthesized
__dyld_private

